# What Does OS Actually Do Every Second?
________________________________________

Suppose you open:
Chrome
WhatsApp
Spotify
VS Code

OS continuously:

Process Management
Tracks all running programs.

Memory Management
Allocates RAM.

File Management
Reads/writes files.

Device Management
Handles keyboard, mouse, speaker.

Security
Checks permissions.

Scheduling
Shares CPU.

All this happens every second.

