# Final One-Line Understanding
_____________________________
Hardware = Workers
Applications = Customers
Operating System = Manager

Without workers → nothing happens.
Without customers → no work.
Without manager → chaos.

That's why Operating System is the most important software in a computer, because it controls and coordinates all hardware and software resources.
